// red.exe's icon, compiled into the Windows build (CMakeLists.txt).
//
// Named GLFW_ICON because GLFW, creating red's window, loads the icon
// resource of that name for the title bar and taskbar; Explorer shows the
// exe's first icon resource, which is this one too.
//
// red.ico holds icon.png (repo root) at 16-256 px. Regenerate it if that
// image changes.
GLFW_ICON ICON "red.ico"
